---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer class="border-t border-white/5 bg-black pt-12 pb-8 text-center md:text-left mt-auto">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
        
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6 mb-8">
            <div class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
                <i class="ph-fill ph-wallet text-shopee"></i>
                <span>SPay<span class="text-shopee">Ref</span></span>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex gap-6 text-sm text-gray-500 font-medium">
                <a href="/" class="hover:text-shopee transition-colors">Home</a>
                <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-shopee transition-colors">Blog</a>
                <a href="/about" class="hover:text-shopee transition-colors">About</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mx-auto md:mx-0">
            <strong>Disclaimer & Disclosure:</strong> Situs ini adalah landing page partner afiliasi independen dan bukan situs resmi PT AirPay International Indonesia. Seluruh aset merek dagang (Shopee, ShopeePay) adalah milik pemegang hak resminya masing-masing.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-8 text-[10px] text-gray-700 text-center border-t border-white/5 pt-4">
            &copy; {today.getFullYear()} Nando Rifky. All rights reserved.
        </p>
    </div>
</footer>

<style>
    a { text-decoration: none; }
</style>